Subject: [PATCH] Add the Seasonal Backgrounds settings toggle

Adds the SEASONAL_BACKGROUNDS boolean option, an isSeasonalBackgroundEnabled()
accessor, and getSeasonalBackgroundDir(), which creates the folder if it does
not exist. The directory resolves inside internal storage because every File
in this build now resolves to Gdx.files.local, i.e. Context.getFilesDir() on
Android.

Inserting a new enum constant mid-list is safe: parseOptions() builds a
HashMap keyed by getDisplayName() and looks options up by name, so nothing
depends on ordinal order and existing opsu.cfg files keep working. The option
defaults to false so behaviour is unchanged until a user opts in.

Registering it in the MAIN MENU group is what actually makes it render, since
OptionsOverlay draws OptionGroup.ALL_OPTIONS rather than GameOption.values().
---
 a/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/OptionGroup.java |  1 +
 a/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/Options.java     | 27 ++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 28 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/Options.java b/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/Options.java
--- a/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/Options.java
+++ b/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/Options.java
@@ -640,4 +640,5 @@
 		},
 		DYNAMIC_BACKGROUND ("Dynamic backgrounds", "DynamicBackground", "The current beatmap background will be used as the main menu background.", true),
+		SEASONAL_BACKGROUNDS ("Seasonal Backgrounds", "SeasonalBackgrounds", "Randomly use images from your 'seasonalbackground' folder as the main menu background.\nDrop any number of PNG or JPG files into that folder.", false),
 		LOAD_VERBOSE ("Detailed loading progress", "LoadVerbose", "Display more verbose loading progress in the splash screen.", false),
 		MASTER_VOLUME ("Master", "VolumeUniversal", "Global volume level.", 35, 0, 100) {
@@ -1000,6 +1001,32 @@
 	public static boolean isDynamicBackgroundEnabled() { return GameOption.DYNAMIC_BACKGROUND.getBooleanValue(); }
 
+	/**
+	 * Returns whether or not seasonal backgrounds are enabled.
+	 * @return true if enabled
+	 */
+	public static boolean isSeasonalBackgroundEnabled() { return GameOption.SEASONAL_BACKGROUNDS.getBooleanValue(); }
+
+	/** The seasonal background directory (created when needed). */
+	private static File seasonalBackgroundDir;
+
+	/**
+	 * Returns the seasonal background directory, creating it if it does not
+	 * exist. This resolves inside internal storage because every File in this
+	 * build resolves to Gdx.files.local (Context.getFilesDir() on Android).
+	 * @return the seasonalbackground directory
+	 */
+	public static File getSeasonalBackgroundDir() {
+		if (seasonalBackgroundDir != null && seasonalBackgroundDir.isDirectory())
+			return seasonalBackgroundDir;
+
+		seasonalBackgroundDir = new File(DATA_DIR, "seasonalbackground/");
+		if (!seasonalBackgroundDir.isDirectory() && !seasonalBackgroundDir.mkdir())
+			ErrorHandler.error(String.format("Failed to create seasonal background directory at '%s'.",
+				seasonalBackgroundDir.getAbsolutePath()), null, false);
+		return seasonalBackgroundDir;
+	}
+
 	/**
 	 * Returns whether or not to show perfect hit result bursts.
 	 * @return true if enabled
 	 */
diff --git a/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/OptionGroup.java b/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/OptionGroup.java
--- a/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/OptionGroup.java
+++ b/src/itdelatrisu/opsu/options/OptionGroup.java
@@ -78,5 +78,6 @@
 		new OptionGroup("MAIN MENU", new GameOption[] {
 			GameOption.DYNAMIC_BACKGROUND,
+			GameOption.SEASONAL_BACKGROUNDS,
 			GameOption.PARALLAX,
 			GameOption.ENABLE_THEME_SONG,
 		}),
